WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
But I definitely remember the Rondo.

2
00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:02.910
I certainly remember the cigarettes.

3
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:08.170
I remember him, Mom, I think,
visiting you, on your balcony.

4
00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:10.850
They were sitting outside. It
was always on the balcony.

5
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:15.920
And I feel like I have this vivid
recollection that he told me he doesn't

6
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:21.560
eat dinner. He stops eating at like
four o'clock, or like a late lunch,

7
00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.850
and that was the last meal he
has for the rest of the day.

8
00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:28.770
And it was such a weird
memory, but it stuck with me.

9
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:32.730
You know, that was probably over 20
years ago he told me that story.

10
00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.170
And I just remember, I'm like, oh
my God, someone doesn't eat dinner.

11
00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.380
I think that was just so
wild for me to process.

12
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.960
Food is so amazing. He has a restaurant.

13
00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.460
He doesn't eat dinner.
And so I remember that.

14
00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:47.060
I just remember he was always so
energetic and upbeat and positive,

15
00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:50.490
and just all smiles, you know?
